    "caption": "🔍 Google releases top-tier Gemini 4 Neon\n\nGemini 4 Neon handles six input types and supports a context window and maximum response of 1 million tokens. Built-in tools can run code and control a computer.\n\nAPI access is open at $3 per million input tokens and $15 per million output tokens. It is the fourth Gemini 4 model in four weeks, and the most expensive in the new line.\n\n📊@tech",
